---
import Base from '../layouts/Base.astro';
import Cover from '../components/Cover.astro';
import { AMAZON_URL, RELEASE, isPlaceholder } from '../config';
const preorderLive = !isPlaceholder(AMAZON_URL);
---
<Base title="The Book" description={`The Jovian Crisis, Book One of The Capa Incident. Hard science fiction from the edge of Jupiter. ${RELEASE}.`}>
  <section class="section">
    <div class="wrap grid">
      <div class="side">
        <Cover width={340} />
        <dl class="facts">
          <dt>Series</dt><dd>The Capa Incident, Book One</dd>
          <dt>Release</dt><dd>{RELEASE}</dd>
        </dl>
        {preorderLive ? (
          <a class="btn buy" href={AMAZON_URL} rel="noopener">Pre-order on Amazon</a>
        ) : (
          <span class="btn buy" aria-disabled="true">Pre-order link coming soon</span>
        )}
      </div>

      <article class="prose blurb">
        <p class="eyebrow">The Book</p>
        <h1>The Jovian Crisis</h1>
        <p class="hook"><strong>Some distress calls should stay unanswered.</strong></p>
        <p>
          Kade Holloway flies rescue out of Minerva Station in Jupiter's Trojans, because it's the last place in the
          system where a captain buried in debt can still make the math work. When a dead ship's beacon lights his
          board, he logs first-responder rights under the Belt Code and goes in.
        </p>
        <p>
          The <em>Second Chance</em> is minutes from sublimating. Inside: a crew that tore itself apart, two survivors
          strapped into their crash couches, and a helium-3 claim worth more than every debt Kade will ever owe.
        </p>
        <p>
          He gets the survivors out. Then the ship burns, the proof goes with her, and the claim becomes the most
          dangerous thing in the Jovian system.
        </p>
        <p>
          His ship is impounded. The only way out costs him his license. And whoever gutted the <em>Second Chance</em>
          is still watching the man who walked away with her secret.
        </p>
        <p>
          <em>My air is your air.</em> It's the first rule on Kade's ship. Now he has to find out how far it reaches.
        </p>
        <p class="comp"><em>For readers of The Expanse and Delta-v.</em></p>
      </article>
    </div>
  </section>
</Base>

<style>
  .grid { display: grid; gap: 2.5rem; }
  @media (min-width: 820px) { .grid { grid-template-columns: 340px minmax(0, 1fr); gap: 4rem; align-items: start; } }
  .side { max-width: 300px; width: 100%; margin-inline: auto; }
  @media (min-width: 820px) { .side { max-width: none; position: sticky; top: 6rem; } }
  .facts { display: grid; grid-template-columns: max-content 1fr; gap: 0.3rem 1rem; margin: 1.5rem 0; font-size: 0.95rem; }
  .facts dt { color: var(--muted); }
  .facts dd { margin: 0; }
  .buy { width: 100%; }
  .hook { font-size: 1.2rem; }
  .comp { margin-top: 2rem; padding-top: 1rem; border-top: 1px solid var(--line); color: var(--muted); }
</style>
